# oracle: min_style sd with min_modify line quadratic and min_modify dmax 0.02 (lj cluster, 30 iterations, every thermo row)
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box), all 31 rows: max relative error of the engine pe 1.6e-15, fnorm 4.5e-13.
# oracle-inputs: w150mn_lj_cluster.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
boundary        f f f
read_data       w150mn_lj_cluster.data
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor        0.3 bin
min_style       sd
min_modify      dmax 0.02
thermo_style    custom step pe fnorm
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          1
minimize        0 0 30 1000
